# The record crawl's output, whose line breaks carry meaning. It is written one
# record to a line so that a weekly refresh diffs as the handful of records that
# changed; Prettier would give every field of every record its own line and turn
# a hundred and thirty thousand records into several million lines, which is a
# diff nobody can review and the reason the writer is hand-rolled. Only the
# snapshots -- the curated mapping beside them is ordinary JSON and stays formatted.
data/sources/records/snapshots/

